    "description": "<p><strong>Advanced Move.</strong> <em>Requires Dispel Magic or Counterspell.</em> When you Push Yourself to Dispel Magic or Counterspell, on a 7+ you can absorb and store the magical effect for later. The magic can then be released like Evoking a Spell, after which the stored magic dissipates. If you release the stored magic immediately after absorbing it, you can Evoke with Advantage. You can only store one magical effect at a time.</p>",
